# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Single source of control for all HTB lab folders under easy/.
# Policy: track ONLY the written deliverables (the Markdown writeups).
# Everything else — recon evidence, loot, private keys, PoC exploits, tooling,
# PDFs/HTML, pcaps, screenshots — is ignored and never leaves this machine.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# 1) Ignore everything by default.
*

# 2) …but let git descend into subdirectories so it can find the files below.
!*/

# 3) Whitelist the deliverable docs (these names are kept at any depth).
!GLOBAL_CONTEXT.md
!WALKTHROUGH.md
!walkthrough.md
!REPORT.md
!STORY.md
!CTF_GUIDE.md

# 4) Whitelist images that the writeups actually embed (so docs render on git).
#    Only the screenshots referenced by Touch/WALKTHROUGH.md — the other ~290
#    screenshots in that loot/ dir stay ignored. These show the kiosk-escape
#    chain (a couple display user.txt on-screen; kept intentionally per request).
!Touch/loot/rdp_screens/00_initial_connect.png
!Touch/loot/rdp_screens/01_self_checkin_home.png
!Touch/loot/rdp_screens/02_winu_easeofaccess.png
!Touch/loot/rdp_screens/06_narrator_guide_click.png
!Touch/loot/rdp_screens/07_narrator_guide_after_enter.png
!Touch/loot/rdp_screens/08_file_users.png
!Touch/loot/rdp_screens/09_kioskuser_desktop.png
!Touch/loot/rdp_screens/11_usertxt_clean.png
!Touch/loot/rdp_screens/19_filetype_dropdown.png
!Touch/loot/rdp_screens/20_allfiles_selected.png
!Touch/loot/rdp_screens/23_after_full_path_enter.png
!Touch/loot/rdp_screens/24_cmd_whoami_flag.png

# 5) Keep this control file itself (root only).
!/.gitignore

# ── Notes ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# • To also publish a lab's tooling or evidence, add a targeted exception, e.g.:
#       !cohort/00try/ws_exec.py
#   (place it AFTER the rules above so it wins).
# • HTB flags in the tracked Markdown are redacted to [REDACTED-HTB-FLAG].
#   Credentials/passwords in the writeups are NOT redacted — review before
#   making the repo public, and confirm each machine is retired per HTB rules.
